    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is a convenient program for creating and maintaining a personal game diary. It allows you to store information about your games, keep notes with the ability to format text and insert images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the program:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add games to a personal list with the status of the passage: &quot;Planning&quot;, &quot;In progress&quot;, &quot;Completed&quot;, &quot;Abandoned&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit notes with text formatting (bold, italics, underline), the ability to insert screenshots and other images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible sorting and quick search for games in the list.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient and intuitive interface with support for dark mode for comfortable use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in statistics showing the total number of games and the number of games for each status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations of interface elements for a more pleasant user experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is an ideal solution for players who want to conveniently organize their gaming memories and plans in one place.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is a convenient program for creating and maintaining a personal game diary. It allows you to store information about your games, keep notes with the ability to format text and insert images.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Main features of the program:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Add games to a personal list with the status of the passage: &quot;Planning&quot;, &quot;In progress&quot;, &quot;Completed&quot;, &quot;Abandoned&quot;.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Edit notes with text formatting (bold, italics, underline), the ability to insert screenshots and other images.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Flexible sorting and quick search for games in the list.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Convenient and intuitive interface with support for dark mode for comfortable use.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built-in statistics showing the total number of games and the number of games for each status.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animations of interface elements for a more pleasant user experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game Diary is an ideal solution for players who want to conveniently organize their gaming memories and plans in one place.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Game Diary is a modern gaming diary that allows you to easily track your games: planned, in progress, completed or abandoned. Keep notes with screenshots, sort and filter by status.",
